<title>USA: Realty Income buys properties for $27.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Realty Income buys properties for $27.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ESCONDIDO, Calif. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realty Income Corp said it bought 37 retail properties in 13 states for $27.5 million.</p>
<p>The 37 properties contain about 416,300 leasable square feet and are 100 percent leased.</p>
<p>These acquisitions bring Realty Income's total purchases for 1996 to 57 retail properties for $50.3 million.</p>
</text>
